n80|  failure (run 35048178384). My delta touches only the 2 mapper/test paths.\n81|  The `weak let` diagnostic is language-level, not SDK-dependent; no source\n82|  repair was attempted here per the publication-only scope.\n83|- Toolchain honesty: this job log contains zero toolchain-identifying strings\n84|  (0 x `Xcode_16.4`, `MacOSX15.5.sdk`, `arm64-apple-macos15.0`, `swiftlang`,\n85|  `Apple Swift`) because the SwiftPM phase prints none. The workflow runs\n86|  `make credential-free-validate` on `macos-15` with no Xcode pin in\n87|  `.github/workflows/ci.yml`, the Makefile, or the fixture script. No\n88|  Xcode/Swift version is claimed for this run from this log alone.\n89|- Full failing-job log attached as\n90|  `TASK-260916-235lb7_ci-35087910852-failed-job.log` (685 lines).\n91|  No synthetic statuses; no local mirror substituted for hosted results.\n92|\n93|## Local validation (delivery worktree, exact new head)\n94|\n95|Personally rerun in this run (all exit 0 unless noted):\n96|- Fresh `git ls-remote --symref origin HEAD`, delivery/main ls-remote (twice:\n97|  pre-act and immediately pre-push), `refs/pull/6/head` fetch + `FETCH_HEAD`\n98|  rev-parse; prospective-tree reproduction via scratch Git index\n99|  (`b383baa...`, exit 0, exactly 2 paths +32/-7).\n100|- Managed CR worktree `status` + `rev-parse HEAD` + `hash-object` of all 3\n101|  paths (blobs equal rev 2 candidate); delivery worktree pre/post-copy\n102|  `hash-object`, `cmp` cross-checks, staged `write-tree` equality,\n103|  `diff --check` (exit 0), `swift-format lint --strict` on both changed\n104|  files (exit 0).\n105|- New-head `verify-commit` (good), `--show-signature` log, author/committer\n106|  dates (current), parent rev-parse, full 6-commit log, `merge-base\n107|  --is-ancestor`, `rev-list --count` (=1), `diff --name-only` vs parent,\n108|  `ls-tree` of mapper/test/fixture, prior-head `verify-commit` (good).\n109|- Push result (`a46e2ba..310a560`, exit 0, no force) + post-push ls-remote